## Retest summary (Web app)

| Finding | Pass criteria |
|---------|---------------|
| F1 | User B everywhere after User A logout + User B login |
| F2 | No config leak endpoints; no RBAC/internal URLs in prod bundle |
| F4 | Restricted role blocked on direct route/API access |
| F5 | Visible endpoints authz-protected |
| F7 | Session cookies HttpOnly + Secure |
| F3 | Server rejects invalid uploads (client UI is supplemental) |
